---
title: "Chumbe Island Coral Park"
description: "Visit Chumbe Island, the world's first private marine conservation park, with a guided snorkel over protected coral and a forest nature walk."
permalink: "/tours/chumbe-island/index.html"
tour_slug: "chumbe-island"
---
{% include "seo.njk" %}
{% include "header.njk" %}

<main class="tour-detail">
  <section class="tour-hero" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--dct-palm) 0%, var(--dct-ocean) 100%);">
    <div class="tour-hero-content">
      {% set featured = page.inputPath | featuredImage %}
{% set cdnSrc = page.inputPath | cdnImage %}
<img src="{{ cdnSrc }}" alt="{{ featured.featuredAlt or page.title }}" class="tour-hero-image" loading="lazy">

      <span class="card-badge badge-marine">Marine Excursion</span>
      <h1>Chumbe Island coral park day</h1>
      <p class="tour-meta">Full day · Mbweni → Chumbe Island</p>
      <div class="tour-price-box">
        <span class="price-label">From</span>
        <span class="price-amount">{% catPrice "chumbe-island" %}</span>
        <span class="price-note">per person</span>
      </div>
      <a href="https://wa.me/{{ site.contact.whatsapp }}?text=I%27d%20like%20to%20book%20chumbe%20island" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Book via WhatsApp</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="tour-grid">
    <div class="tour-main">
      <section class="tour-section">
        <h2>Overview</h2>
        <p>Visit the world's first private marine conservation park. Chumbe Island limits visitors to just 14 per day to protect its fragile coral ecosystem. Snorkel guided by a marine biologist, learn about coral restoration, and support conservation.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="tour-section">
        <h2>What to Expect</h2>
        <ul class="expect-list">
      <li>Full-day trip from Mbweni (south of Stone Town)</li>
      <li>Small-group snorkeling (max 14 guests per day)</li>
      <li>Marine biologist guide explains coral reef ecology</li>
      <li>Snorkel over pristine, protected coral walls</li>
      <li>Organic lunch and refreshments included</li>
      <li>Day room access for changing and relaxing</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="tour-section">
        <h2>Tour Highlights in Pictures</h2>
        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; margin-top: 1rem;">
          <div style="border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);">
            <img src="{{ 'underwater-fish-coral-reef-zanzibar.jpg' | cdnFile }}" alt="{{ 'underwater-fish-coral-reef-zanzibar.jpg' | canonicalAlt }}" style="width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover;" loading="lazy">
            <span style="display: block; padding: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.8rem; color: #4e5d66; background: #fdfaf5; text-align: center;">Protected Coral Sanctuary</span>
          </div>
          <div style="border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);">
            <img src="{{ 'boat-deck-view-turquoise-water-island.jpg' | cdnFile }}" alt="{{ 'boat-deck-view-turquoise-water-island.jpg' | canonicalAlt }}" style="width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover;" loading="lazy">
            <span style="display: block; padding: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.8rem; color: #4e5d66; background: #fdfaf5; text-align: center;">Island Sanctuary Approach</span>
          </div>
          <div style="border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);">
            <img src="{{ 'aerial-beach-boat-turquoise-water.jpg' | cdnFile }}" alt="{{ 'aerial-beach-boat-turquoise-water.jpg' | canonicalAlt }}" style="width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover;" loading="lazy">
            <span style="display: block; padding: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.8rem; color: #4e5d66; background: #fdfaf5; text-align: center;">Crystal Eco Lagoon</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="tour-section">
        <h2>Duration & Meeting Point</h2>
        <p><strong>Duration:</strong> Full day (8–9 hours)</p>
        <p><strong>Meeting point:</strong> Mbweni Beach (pickup from central hotels by arrangement)</p>
      </section>
      <section class="tour-section">
        <h2>Important Notes</h2>
        <ul class="notes-list">
      <li>Advance booking essential — strictly limited to 14 visitors per day</li>
      <li>All profits support the Chumbe Conservation Fund</li>
      <li>Bring your own snorkel mask if you have one</li>
      <li>No single supplement for solo travelers</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
      <section class="tour-section">
        <h2>Inclusions</h2>
        <ul class="includes-list">
      <li>Boat, marine-biology guide, snorkeling, lunch, day room</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
      {% include "tour-reviews.njk" %}
      {% include "tour-faq.njk" %}
    </div>

    <aside class="tour-sidebar">
      <div class="info-card">
        <h3>📍 Tour Details</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><span class="label">Duration:</span><span class="value">Full day (8–9 hours)</span></li>
          <li><span class="label">Location:</span><span class="value">Mbweni → Chumbe Island</span></li>
          <li><span class="label">Category:</span><span class="value">{{ 'MAR' | attractionTypeLabel }}</span></li>
        </ul>
        <div class="booking-card">
          <div class="price">{% catPrice tour_slug %} <span style="font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 500; opacity: 0.85;">/ person</span></div>
          <h3>Ready to Book?</h3>
          <p style="opacity: 0.8; margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">Send us your preferred date and group size on WhatsApp. We'll confirm with a fixed price including all fees.</p>
          <a href="https://wa.me/{{ site.contact.whatsapp }}?text=Jambo%20Spice%20%26%20Sail%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20book%20{{ title | urlencode }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-accent btn-lg">WhatsApp: {{ site.contact.whatsapp_display }}</a>
          <p class="note">✓ Marine conservation fees included • Boat transfer included • 100% Weather Guarantee</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
  {% include "tour-mobile-sticky.njk" %}
</main>

{% include "footer.njk" %}
